OL,3,GNEWSASmart camera to cut fire engine
OL,4,Adeployment delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA smart camera has been installed at a
OL,7,Fbusy junction in Hull to help the fire
OL,8,Fservice respond more quickly to
OL,9,Femergencies.
OL,11,FThe camera, placed at the junction of
OL,12,FSouthcoates Lane and Rosmead Street,
OL,13,Fwill help alert motorists more
OL,14,Feffectively when emergency vehicles
OL,15,Fleave East Hull fire station.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
