OL,3,GNEWSASmart camera to cut fire engine
OL,4,Adeployment delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Mark Ieronimo, of Hull City
OL,7,FCouncil, which developed the
OL,8,Finitiative, said: "Following concerns
OL,9,Fraised by the station about access for
OL,10,Femergency vehicles, we were determined
OL,11,Fto deliver a solution that would make a
OL,12,Freal difference."
OL,14,FHe said the camera would help
OL,15,Ffirefighters "exit the station safely
OL,16,Fand efficiently, reducing delays and
OL,17,Fsupporting emergency responses across
OL,18,Fthe city".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
